"(i.e., ``surftype=\"image\"``) [Default is :gmt-term:`GMT_GRAPHICS_DPU`]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:64
msgid ""
"Make grid nodes with z = NaN transparent, using the color-masking feature in "
"PostScript Level 3. Only applies when ``surftype=\"image\"``."
msgstr ""

