"attributes used for the contours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:72
msgid ""
"Set the pen attributes used for the mesh. Need to set ``surftype`` to "
"``\"mesh\"``, or ``\"surface+mesh\"`` to draw meshlines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:75
msgid "Set the mesh fill in mesh plot or waterfall plots [Default is white]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:77
msgid ""
"Draw a plane at the specified z-level. If ``True``, defaults to the minimum "
"value in the grid. However, if ``region`` was used to set *zmin/zmax* then "
"*zmin* is used if it is less than the grid minimum value. Use ``facade_pen`` "
"and ``facade_fill`` to control the appearance of the plane. **Note**: For "
"GMT<=6.7.0, *zmin* set in ``region`` has no effect due to a GMT bug."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:84
msgid ""
"Fill for the frontal facade between the plane specified by ``plane`` and the "
"data perimeter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.15/site-packages/pygmt/src/grdview.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.grdview.grdview:87
